0028b8d4e38d7fee2a17.mp4?t=1707364449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272550/extras/ccec2b92c0c7d2fb388d8ae3a8dd16bd.webp?t=1707364449\" /></div><br>Complete diverse missions, including an enthralling and cinematic main storyline, side quests filled with memorable action and characters, PvP multiplayer battles, PvE multiplayer bounties, and more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272550/extras/512911c93d9d411ef02972b6904e9c66.poster.avif?t=1707364449\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272550/extras/512911c93d9d411ef02972b6904e9c66.webm?t=1707364449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272550/extras/512911c93d9d411ef02972b6904e9c66.mp4?t=1707364449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272550/extras/543d1fda1127602e66c6b72d8cfb8c26.webp?t=1707364449\" /></div><br>Level up through RPG-style tech advancement, and choose between paths of heroism and ruthlessness.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272550/extras/806dd2b155389b6f973d3ca716539ba4.poster.avif?t=1707364449\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272550/extras/806dd2b155389b6f973d3ca716539ba4.webm?t=1707364449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272550/extras/806dd2b155389b6f973d3ca716539ba4.mp4?t=1707364449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
